n icon_comment\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\" /></svg>Comments</a></li><li><a data-label=\"related_btn\" href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/5073725/nightmareathillmare\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\"><svg stroke-width=\"2\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_germania-one\"><div class=\"header\" id=\"header\"><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">NightmareAtHillmare</h1></div><div class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget buy_on_top\" id=\"view_game_7001560\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable game</p><div class=\"buy_row\"><div class=\"button_message\"><a href=\"https://neitsab-ertiam.itch.io/nightmareathillmare/purchase\" class=\"button buy_btn\">Download Now</a><span class=\"buy_message\"><span class=\"sub\">Name your own price</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p>A short game I made as a solo project in aproximately 24h of work over 2 days. Hope you&#x27;ll&nbsp; have fun playing it and remember to READ the game guide manual in the main menu made to help you feel like you&#x27;re&nbsp;reminiscing about&nbsp;the elden days of early video games where you&#x27;d read a manual sometimes just to understand how a level or the whole game would work.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Thank you very much if&nbsp; you&#x27;ve tried the game out, more maps with more complete and complex labyrinthe are coming Soon&trade; to the game build.</p>\r\n<p>Here are the links to the various assets I used and a little shoutout :</p>\r\n<p>All models and anims found on mixamo :</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.mixamo.com/#/?page=1&type=Character\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">https://www.mixamo.com/</a></p>\r\n<p>Character :&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>SKELETONZOMBIE T AVELANCE</p>\r\n<p>Animations :&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>ZOMBIE IDLE (first one) and DRUNK WALK</p>\r\n<p>All sounds from Pixabay (edited with&nbsp;AudioMass) :</p>\r\n<p>Main menu music :&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://pixabay.com/fr/music/sc%C3%A8ne-dhorreur-horror-ambience-569585/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">https://pixabay.com/fr/music/sc%C3%A8ne-dhorreur-horror-ambience-569585/</a></p>\r\n<p>Walking Footsteps :</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://pixabay.com/fr/sound-effects/ville-walking-on-a-gravel-169409/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">https://pixabay.com/fr/sound-effects/ville-walking-on-a-gravel-169409/</a><br></p>\r\n<p>Running Footsteps :</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/film-special-effects-running-on-gravel-301880/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/film-special-effects-running-on-gravel-301880/</a><br></p>\r\n<p>Character Breath :</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/people-out-of-breath-male-176715/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/people-out-of-breath-male-176715/</a><br></p>\r\n<p>Heartbeat :</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://pixabay.com/fr/sound-effects/films-et-effets-sp%C3%A9ciaux-heartbeat-sound-372448/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">https://pixabay.com/fr/sound-effects/films-et-effets-sp%C3%A9ciaux-heartbeat-sou...</a><br></p>\r\n<p>Monster Breath :</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/horror-zombie-breathing-70682/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/horror-zombie-breathing-70682/</a><br></p>\r\n<p>Death SFX :</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://pixabay.com/fr/sound-effects/horreur-male-death-sound-128357/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">https://pixabay.com/fr/sound-effects/horreur-male-death-sound-128357/<br><br></a>Floor and walls horribly used gravel texture :</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://polyhaven.com/a/rocky_gravel\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">https://polyhaven.com/a/rocky_gravel</a><br></p>\r\n<p>Shoutout to this one guy on youtube for the working local fog in unreal :</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@CGFastTips\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">https://www.youtube.com/@CGFastTips</a><br></p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"toggle_info_btn\">More information<svg width=\"12\" height=\"6\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" aria-hidden><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\" id=\"game_info_panel_7631335\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Published</td><td><abbr title=\"29 September 2026 @ 13:36 UTC\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\"></span> 4 hours ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td><a 